module

public import Rule30Open.Columns.ClassGame

/-!
# The game with cyclic classes excludes `000000000010010011`

[ClassGame](ClassGame.md) proves, for any block with a valid `ClassCert`, that no column of the orbit of a row with a
leftmost 1 repeats it (`class_column`). The class-test survey at period 18 and 16 cells finds fifteen blocks that the
game or the class test closes and that nothing else in this repository or the kit excludes. This module proves the
exclusion of `000000000010010011`, from a certificate at the least width at which the class test closes it, made by
`computations/class_blocks_18.py`. The other blocks of period 18 in Lean are in [ClassBlocks18](ClassBlocks18.md),
[ClassBlocks18Wide](ClassBlocks18Wide.md).

For each block `b` there is one section with the certificate `cls<b>`, one kernel check per width and phase and one per
phase of the classes, and the theorems `column_not_<b>` (every column of every row with a leftmost 1),
`center_not_<b>` (the center column) and `not_eventually_<b>` (the kit's form).

The natural-language argument is `ClassBlocks18Mid.md`, beside this file.
-/

@[expose] public section

-- Sequential elaboration: the kernel checks would otherwise run in parallel and stack their memory.
set_option Elab.async false

namespace Rule30Open

open Ruliology.CellularAutomata
open Rule30StripCertificateTable (wordOf)

